WEBVTT

00:01.064 --> 00:02.356
<i>Something's wrong.</i>

00:02.440 --> 00:05.401
<i>There's no way I should be able
to turn it back on!</i>

00:05.485 --> 00:08.279
It was you…
You reignited the flame.

00:08.989 --> 00:12.867
That's too far, bastardo!
You've messed with the wrong kid!

00:14.577 --> 00:16.161
This soul…

00:16.246 --> 00:19.666
is not the soul of the chosen.

00:19.749 --> 00:21.792
<i>The soul of the chosen?</i>

00:25.255 --> 00:26.798
H-Hey, are you…

00:27.716 --> 00:31.094
<i>Emorto. There's no wound,
but he's dead…</i>

00:44.566 --> 00:46.401
You too have reignited the flame.

00:46.776 --> 00:51.276
I offer you salvation.
Before you lies two paths…

00:55.535 --> 00:59.288
<i>So he attacks anyone who witnesses
the lighter being reignited</i>

01:10.633 --> 01:12.092
Th-This is…

01:12.135 --> 01:14.387
This cazzo…
He emerged from my shadow.

01:14.471 --> 01:17.182
This is how he's gonna
rip out my soul!

01:28.610 --> 01:33.110
<i>Heavy stones of fate
are holding down my dreams</i>

01:33.948 --> 01:37.409
<i>It feels as if I'm being crushed</i>

01:39.162 --> 01:43.662
<i>I've been staggering around
with nowhere to hide</i>

01:44.334 --> 01:48.212
<i>But I will never give in</i>

01:48.254 --> 01:52.754
<i>I know there are fragments of hope
buried beneath all that rubble</i>

02:00.016 --> 02:04.516
<i>I will find them with my own hands
and turn this world upside down</i>

02:13.113 --> 02:17.613
<i>Fighting gold
We will shine one day</i>

02:19.077 --> 02:23.577
<i>As long as we continue to
believe in our own path</i>

02:26.167 --> 02:29.295
<i>We are unyielding souls</i>

02:29.379 --> 02:33.879
<i>Our battle against god
will keep raging on</i>

02:34.592 --> 02:39.092
<i>Until our final days
Fighting gold</i>

02:48.815 --> 02:52.609
I offer you salvation.
Before you lies two paths…

02:49.023 --> 02:53.523
EPISODE 04
JOINING THE FAMIGLIA

02:52.777 --> 02:53.799
Do you live and become
one of the chosen…

02:55.155 --> 02:58.366
<i>It's no use…
He's stronger than Golden Wind</i>

02:58.950 --> 03:01.869
<i>The old man expired after
the arrow impaled his soul.</i>

03:01.953 --> 03:04.246
<i>But what about me?</i>

03:04.330 --> 03:05.998
<i>What will happen if he gets
my Stand?</i>

03:06.332 --> 03:09.084
…or do you proceed along
the path of death?

03:14.215 --> 03:15.925
Th-This arrow…

03:15.967 --> 03:18.970
If he drives that thing right through me,
there's no way I'll survive!

03:21.264 --> 03:22.473
Then I have no choice!

03:22.807 --> 03:25.476
I don't really care
if Polpo is a capo.

03:25.602 --> 03:27.145
If he thinks
he can derail my dreams

03:27.270 --> 03:31.770
and murder innocent bystanders
like that nice old man

03:32.275 --> 03:33.818
then he'll have to die by my hand!

03:39.616 --> 03:41.784
Muda! Muda! Muda! Muda!

03:44.662 --> 03:46.705
Golden Wind…

03:46.831 --> 03:48.833
will set your senses on fire,

03:48.875 --> 03:51.210
making everything else appear to
be moving in slow motion.

03:56.966 --> 03:58.676
Che diavolo! He's gone!

03:59.093 --> 04:01.804
He should have
zero motor control now.

04:01.930 --> 04:04.933
At most, he should be able
to move at a crawl.

04:05.308 --> 04:06.934
There's no way
he could just disappear!

04:09.354 --> 04:11.022
He has to be
around here somewhere…

04:11.648 --> 04:12.857
I know he is!

04:15.693 --> 04:19.154
I have to find him before
the effects wear off.

04:19.822 --> 04:21.240
He'll try to attack me again.

04:32.126 --> 04:33.043
What?!

04:33.419 --> 04:36.547
He was hiding
in the shadows! Merda!

04:36.923 --> 04:39.884
He's definitely slower,
but just as powerful as before!

04:40.260 --> 04:42.053
I'm completely paralyzed!

05:12.083 --> 05:14.335
The shadows!
That's how he does it!

05:14.544 --> 05:18.756
He moves shadow to shadow,
traveling at lightning speed…

05:20.049 --> 05:22.760
But he shouldn't be able to
touch me here in the sunlight.

05:23.386 --> 05:27.431
Still, the sun will disappear behind
the school in a matter of minutes.

05:27.557 --> 05:30.059
Then I'll really be screwed.

05:30.393 --> 05:34.893
Now if I can just drag him
into the sunlight, maybe I could…

05:35.148 --> 05:36.858
Hey, it's worth a shot.

05:36.899 --> 05:39.276
Question is,
how do I drive him out of the dark?

05:39.694 --> 05:42.279
Come on, think… He's waiting
for you to make your move.

05:42.614 --> 05:44.198
All he has to do is wait

05:44.616 --> 05:47.118
and watch the sun set
with that creepy grin on his face.

05:47.869 --> 05:48.953
Hey!

05:48.995 --> 05:51.706
What are you doing,
Giorno Giovanna?!

05:51.748 --> 05:52.707
Koichi!

05:52.749 --> 05:56.002
Why is there a guy lying lifelessly
at the bottom of the stairs?!

05:56.085 --> 05:57.920
What did you do to him?!

05:57.962 --> 05:59.296
Hey, you've got it all wrong!

05:59.380 --> 06:00.547
I'm innocent!

06:00.590 --> 06:02.300
That Stand right there atta—

06:02.717 --> 06:04.009
I've got it all wrong?

06:04.093 --> 06:07.513
I saw you…
You were talking to that old man!

06:07.597 --> 06:10.016
I was watching from the window!

06:10.058 --> 06:12.226
You were watching? So then…

06:13.019 --> 06:16.480
Cavolo…
Did you see the lighter ignite?

06:16.564 --> 06:17.106
Huh?

06:17.106 --> 06:19.441
Don't step into
the handrail's shadow, Koichi!

06:19.859 --> 06:21.443
Don't step on the shadow…

06:22.820 --> 06:23.946
Oh, cazzo, no!

06:24.030 --> 06:25.948
You saw the reignition…

06:25.990 --> 06:28.492
Before you lies two paths.

06:28.534 --> 06:30.827
- Do you live and become one of the chosen…
- What… in the…

06:31.496 --> 06:33.748
or do you proceed along
the path of death?

06:33.831 --> 06:34.748
This arrow is…

06:34.832 --> 06:37.125
Golden Wind!

06:41.422 --> 06:43.215
The pain… It's searing…

06:43.299 --> 06:45.509
That hurt like all hell,
but at least now…

06:45.635 --> 06:48.596
I'm able to give you
a healthy dose of sunshine.

07:00.149 --> 07:01.650
I transformed that handrail

07:01.734 --> 07:03.902
into a few vines of
low-hanging morning glories.

07:04.278 --> 07:06.363
No more comfy shadows
to hide in, are there?!

07:11.494 --> 07:12.453
So close!

07:12.537 --> 07:14.747
So there were some
more shadows nearby…

07:15.373 --> 07:18.709
If I can just pull him into
the complete sunlight

07:18.835 --> 07:20.711
I have a chance at
offing him for good.

07:21.003 --> 07:22.212
W-What was…

07:22.630 --> 07:24.048
What was that Stand?!

07:24.257 --> 07:26.050
You saw for yourself,
he's trying to kill us.

07:26.718 --> 07:29.345
That old man relit the lighter
and was killed.

07:29.846 --> 07:31.681
We happened to see him do it

07:31.723 --> 07:34.434
and now he's targeting us both.

07:34.517 --> 07:35.768
I don't mean that.

07:36.102 --> 07:39.355
That arrow…
It's from <i>the Bow and Arrow!</i>

07:39.731 --> 07:41.733
To think there was one
in Italy too…

07:41.774 --> 07:44.026
Just what have you been doing,
Giorno Giovanna?!

07:44.068 --> 07:45.611
Are you somehow responsible

07:45.695 --> 07:47.571
for the appearance of another
arrow-wielding Stand?!

07:50.575 --> 07:52.785
It'll take too long to explain…

07:53.035 --> 07:54.995
In a lot of ways,
you know as much as I do.

07:55.788 --> 07:58.248
Do you know anything
about that Stand?

07:58.624 --> 08:00.626
And about that arrow?

08:00.710 --> 08:02.294
Why did you save me just now?

08:02.378 --> 08:04.338
Forget that. I need to know more
about the arrow!

08:04.422 --> 08:05.506
The sun's about to set!

08:05.590 --> 08:07.133
Why did you save me?!

08:07.216 --> 08:10.344
Don't for a second think I would
ever feel indebted to some thief!

08:13.848 --> 08:16.517
The lighter was ignited ultimately
because of my own actions.

08:17.185 --> 08:20.062
The old man simply got caught up
in this whole mess.

08:20.480 --> 08:22.231
The whole thing makes me sick.

08:22.982 --> 08:25.609
I believe in what I set out to do,

08:25.693 --> 08:27.736
but that doesn't make
the grief feel any less.

08:28.905 --> 08:31.073
But I won't give up…

08:31.657 --> 08:33.075
I have a purpose,

08:33.117 --> 08:35.536
and I'm willing to put it all on
the line to realize my dream.

08:41.250 --> 08:42.793
Two years ago,

08:42.835 --> 08:45.420
I was shot with an arrow much
like the one we witnessed today.

08:45.463 --> 08:47.173
That arrow gave me my Stand.

08:47.715 --> 08:51.593
If the arrow fails to awaken
the ability, the victim is killed.

08:51.844 --> 08:53.679
<i>Awaken the ability?</i>

08:53.763 --> 08:54.805
<i>Of course!</i>

08:55.223 --> 08:58.226
<i>One of the chosen… That's it!</i>

08:58.601 --> 09:00.185
<i>The chosen one whose Stand
has awakened!</i>

09:00.228 --> 09:03.940
<i>That must be what Polpo is testing!</i>

09:04.899 --> 09:06.692
I don't know where
the arrow came from,

09:06.776 --> 09:11.113
but I've faced
this kind of Stand before.

09:11.572 --> 09:14.491
It's a self-piloting
long-range Stand!

09:14.951 --> 09:16.827
Self-piloting long-range Stand?

09:17.036 --> 09:19.455
It's limited to simple attacks,

09:19.539 --> 09:22.208
but won't let up until
it destroys its target.

09:22.625 --> 09:25.836
Our best strategy is to locate
the Stand user and take him down.

09:26.546 --> 09:28.839
As much as I'd like to, we can't.

09:29.423 --> 09:32.259
He's safe behind bars.
There's no way we can get to him.

09:33.427 --> 09:34.636
Either way

09:34.637 --> 09:37.640
he's stuck hiding in
the school's shadow for now.

09:37.640 --> 09:40.559
We need to get to the side
facing the sun while we can.

09:40.810 --> 09:43.562
Then, before the sun
sets completely,

09:43.646 --> 09:46.732
we'll lure him into the shadow
of some moving object

09:46.816 --> 09:48.526
before ripping it away
when he least expects it.

09:48.818 --> 09:51.946
He'll have no idea what hit him.

09:52.321 --> 09:53.363
Got it!

10:07.211 --> 10:08.086
He's gone!

10:12.008 --> 10:12.883
Preso!

10:13.009 --> 10:14.552
W-What?!

10:17.430 --> 10:19.223
You witnessed the reignition
of the light.

10:20.182 --> 10:21.391
The crows!

10:21.434 --> 10:25.934
He snuck out of the school's shadow
and hid in the shadow of the crows!

10:26.105 --> 10:27.606
This bastardo…

10:28.399 --> 10:29.983
Muda!

10:32.862 --> 10:34.488
Merda!

10:34.530 --> 10:37.741
He's faster and stronger
when he's surrounded by darkness!

10:38.367 --> 10:41.411
Act 3! 3 Freeze!

10:42.705 --> 10:47.205
My Reverb Act 3 can weigh down
Stands and ordinary objects.

10:47.793 --> 10:49.628
The target's hands
have been subdued.

10:49.712 --> 10:52.881
Consider him super glued to
the ground, Master Koichi.

10:58.012 --> 10:59.680
There's no way he should
be able to hang on.

10:59.722 --> 11:02.349
I applied pressure to
every centimeter of his hands!

11:02.892 --> 11:05.394
Bending his fingers should
be impossible!

11:05.436 --> 11:07.062
He's so strong…

11:07.063 --> 11:09.940
This bastard's
just not gonna let go.

11:09.982 --> 11:13.443
Before you lies two paths…

11:13.527 --> 11:14.653
<i>I-It's no use!</i>

11:14.737 --> 11:17.948
<i>When a Stand suffers damage,
the same injuries are felt by the user!</i>

11:18.032 --> 11:21.493
<i>At this rate, he's going to
shatter Giorno's bones!</i>

11:21.577 --> 11:24.288
- Act 3! Release 3 Freeze…
- No.

11:24.580 --> 11:26.707
I'd prefer that you didn't, Koichi.

11:27.833 --> 11:31.378
This ability to weigh down objects…
Don't even think about releasing it.

11:31.462 --> 11:32.713
It's just what I needed.

11:33.422 --> 11:36.591
In fact, you couldn't have
done me a bigger favor!

11:36.676 --> 11:38.969
But he's gonna crush your legs!

11:44.350 --> 11:45.642
W-What?

11:45.768 --> 11:46.643
That tree…

11:47.436 --> 11:49.062
Golden Wind is an ability

11:49.105 --> 11:51.357
that can continuously inject organisms
with life-giving force.

11:51.440 --> 11:53.150
I accelerated its growth

11:53.234 --> 11:55.444
so that it progressed
through its entire life cycle

11:55.528 --> 11:57.071
and now, it's withering away.

11:57.446 --> 11:58.530
Ability?

11:59.156 --> 12:01.658
But that tree's at least
ten meters away…

12:03.494 --> 12:06.455
You dug a hole and
struck the roots!

12:07.581 --> 12:09.416
BAM

12:16.507 --> 12:19.593
Y-You did it! The shadow's gone!

12:19.677 --> 12:21.970
He dragged that creeper
right into the sun!

12:30.146 --> 12:32.982
You seemed to rattle on about
my having two paths

12:33.065 --> 12:36.318
but, unfortunately, you weren't blessed
with such a cornucopia of options.

12:36.402 --> 12:40.864
Koichi, sorry to bother, but could I
ask you to step to the right for me?

12:40.906 --> 12:42.574
Huh? Okay…

12:43.826 --> 12:44.827
Hmm…

12:47.455 --> 12:50.833
Muda! Muda! Muda! Muda!

12:51.500 --> 12:54.711
Soak it all in, stronzo.
Bask in that southern Italian sun.

12:54.795 --> 12:57.380
That's all you get I'm afraid.

12:57.423 --> 12:59.425
Before you lies only one path.

13:12.855 --> 13:14.189
But I wonder…

13:14.231 --> 13:16.733
Was that enough to get me
into the famiglia?

13:17.359 --> 13:18.485
Guess we'll see…

13:23.532 --> 13:25.575
POLPO
SHADOW SABBATH

13:28.954 --> 13:29.913
That arrow…

13:30.289 --> 13:32.499
Its existence in Italy

13:32.875 --> 13:35.002
will only mean more innocent people
being killed!

13:35.211 --> 13:37.588
I've gotta let Jotaro
know everything!

13:40.382 --> 13:42.217
W-What are you doing?

13:42.384 --> 13:44.761
You had mentioned more?

13:45.387 --> 13:47.263
Polpo's Stand with the arrow…

13:47.348 --> 13:49.058
I destroyed him.
You saw with your own eyes.

13:49.266 --> 13:52.477
You destroyed him?
Sorry, but you're mistaken!

13:52.937 --> 13:54.438
I'll admit things would've
been a lot worse

13:54.480 --> 13:56.482
if you hadn't taken care
of that Stand.

13:56.732 --> 14:01.232
The sun only stopped the Stand
from attacking.

14:01.445 --> 14:03.780
The user's perfectly fine,
he's alive and well!

14:03.864 --> 14:05.782
So Polpo's alive?

14:05.991 --> 14:07.784
He is alive…

14:07.868 --> 14:11.913
Self-piloting long-range Stands
have almost no effect on their users.

14:12.373 --> 14:15.376
He probably has no awareness of
a fight ever having taken place.

14:15.417 --> 14:16.793
What?

14:17.169 --> 14:20.005
So he has no idea at all?

14:20.089 --> 14:21.799
Do you think he knows
I'm a Stand user?

14:21.924 --> 14:22.966
You are stubborn.

14:23.050 --> 14:27.304
If anything, he may have felt
an unusual heaviness in his hands.

14:27.346 --> 14:31.391
But there'd be no way of him knowing
you and I are Stand users.

14:33.018 --> 14:36.479
Hey, I'd really appreciate it
if you'd remove your hand.

14:36.605 --> 14:40.108
Sorry, but that's a call
I just can't let you make.

14:41.277 --> 14:42.945
Please, I'm asking you…

14:42.945 --> 14:45.656
We're not dealing with a single enemy,
we're up against an organization.

14:46.198 --> 14:49.826
If you tell someone,
word could get out.

14:49.910 --> 14:50.994
Enemy?

14:51.078 --> 14:52.454
Organization?

14:53.164 --> 14:55.791
You're the only one who will
know about this, okay, Koichi?

14:56.959 --> 14:59.294
THE NEXT DAY

15:13.642 --> 15:17.062
I was about to tuck
into this luscious donation.

15:37.499 --> 15:41.544
Now let's see, where were we?
You are who again?

15:42.922 --> 15:46.258
Giorno… Giorno, uh…

15:46.717 --> 15:48.176
It's Giorno Giovanna.

15:48.552 --> 15:51.429
Ah, of course, my apologies.

15:52.014 --> 15:55.726
My mind always goes elsewhere
when I eat.

15:57.311 --> 15:59.855
The blood goes to the stomach,
and all that…

16:02.691 --> 16:07.191
If I may be so bold, Giorno,
are you a man of God?

16:10.157 --> 16:13.702
Well, I'm not devout,
if that's what you mean.

16:15.454 --> 16:19.954
What I'm about to say runs counter
to the word of God

16:21.794 --> 16:24.463
but I implore you to take
our little chat to heart.

16:24.797 --> 16:29.009
If faith in one's fellow man
is paramount,

16:29.051 --> 16:33.551
then there is no greater offense to
one's fellow man than the act of disrespect.

16:33.597 --> 16:38.097
Now listen carefully,
to abuse that trust…

16:38.227 --> 16:41.730
not only dishonors
the benefactor of that trust…

16:41.814 --> 16:46.314
it jeopardizes
his very life and livelihood.

16:47.403 --> 16:50.364
Never, for the sake of money
and profit,

16:50.531 --> 16:54.451
or for the pettiness of having lost
a seat at the theater or on the bus,

16:54.576 --> 16:58.246
do we condone engaging in conflict
or risking one's own life.

16:58.330 --> 17:02.459
Conflict is for barbarians…
A pastime for fools.

17:03.585 --> 17:04.669
But…

17:04.753 --> 17:09.132
If I or any of my men are disrespected,
all gloves are off.

17:09.925 --> 17:14.387
Murder as recompense for disrespect
is forgiven in the eyes of God.

17:15.347 --> 17:17.474
I suggest you commit that
to memory.

17:18.642 --> 17:20.018
Bravissimo!

17:20.102 --> 17:22.479
I hereby declare you
a member of the famiglia.

17:22.521 --> 17:27.021
You returned the lighter aflame,
as I trusted you would.

17:27.401 --> 17:28.819
You passed the test.

17:35.492 --> 17:38.661
Before you is the badge of
the Passione syndicate.

17:39.621 --> 17:42.165
It is proof of
your successful examination.

17:43.083 --> 17:44.167
For the time being,

17:44.251 --> 17:47.254
you will be taking orders
from Bucciarati.

18:05.105 --> 18:07.774
How about it?
I think this calls for a toast…

18:13.989 --> 18:15.448
<i>That moccioso…</i>

18:15.491 --> 18:18.785
<i>Did he really pull off keeping
the lighter on for twenty four hours?</i>

18:18.994 --> 18:23.373
<i>Or perhaps he reignited the flame
and came out a Stand user?</i>

18:24.958 --> 18:27.043
<i>Oh, who the hell cares…</i>

18:27.127 --> 18:31.381
<i>The young and confused
are easy to use.</i>

18:31.840 --> 18:35.718
<i>Whatever he is,
he will serve us well.</i>

18:43.018 --> 18:44.102
Oh?

18:44.978 --> 18:47.647
I'm certain I closed that…

18:50.651 --> 18:54.237
More blood to
the stomach, I suppose…

19:09.878 --> 19:11.462
So you met again?

19:11.839 --> 19:13.549
<i>I'm sorry, Jotaro.</i>

19:13.590 --> 19:15.049
<i>I've been thinking about it.</i>

19:15.759 --> 19:18.344
This guy, Giorno Giovanna,

19:18.429 --> 19:21.890
he doesn't pose the kind of threat
you were worried about.

19:22.516 --> 19:23.683
<i>Why do you say that?</i>

19:24.226 --> 19:25.060
Well…

19:28.564 --> 19:31.108
I'd like to discuss that
with you in person.

19:31.191 --> 19:32.775
<i>Would you mind?</i>

19:33.735 --> 19:34.861
I got it.

19:35.195 --> 19:37.447
If that's what you want,
then that's what we'll do.

19:37.865 --> 19:39.074
I'll be waiting.

19:39.825 --> 19:41.076
I appreciate it.

19:41.660 --> 19:42.619
Talk soon.

19:45.664 --> 19:48.792
<i>Mr. Jotaro… In the beginning,
I really wasn't sure…</i>

19:49.501 --> 19:53.505
<i>Could this Giorno kid really
have aspirations to become that?</i>

19:53.589 --> 19:55.090
<i>He must be insane…</i>

19:55.716 --> 19:57.676
<i>But now, I feel it in my bones…</i>

19:58.177 --> 20:01.096
<i>He holds honor in his heart.</i>

20:01.847 --> 20:04.224
<i>I know… I'm certain of it…</i>

20:04.933 --> 20:08.019
<i>I watched three generations
of Joestars</i>

20:08.103 --> 20:09.938
<i>fight for good
all the way back in Morioh.</i>

20:11.190 --> 20:14.943
<i>It was as if their righteous hearts
became their life energy,</i>

20:14.985 --> 20:16.444
<i>their motive to carry on.</i>

20:17.529 --> 20:19.906
<i>I witnessed the same fire
in his eyes.</i>

20:20.782 --> 20:22.325
<i>I have no doubt,</i>

20:22.409 --> 20:26.162
<i>the blood coursing through his veins
holds the determination of the Joestars.</i>

20:27.206 --> 20:31.706
<i>It's why I'll honor his wish and
keep his secret in confidence.</i>

20:34.630 --> 20:38.634
<i>I promise to protect
that golden dream.</i>

20:40.260 --> 20:43.388
Well, I think I'm long overdue
for some sightseeing.

20:45.682 --> 20:47.684
THE NEXT DAY

20:50.812 --> 20:53.272
Come with me, Giorno Giovanna.

21:05.744 --> 21:07.996
What was that noise?

21:09.498 --> 21:10.874
Oh well.

21:10.999 --> 21:15.499
<i>So an act of disrespect can
warrant murder, you say?</i>

21:16.004 --> 21:20.341
<i>I see now You taught me
a very important lesson.</i>

21:21.093 --> 21:24.888
<i>You disrespected the life of
that innocent old man.</i>

21:30.519 --> 21:34.564
<i>So I transformed one of
your guns into your favorite food.</i>

21:37.943 --> 21:41.696
<i>It's your last meal…
I hope you enjoy it.</i>

21:53.792 --> 21:56.377
So… Where are we going?

21:57.921 --> 21:59.464
You're going to meet my team.

22:03.468 --> 22:05.678
They're all Stand users.

23:38.271 --> 23:42.108
EPISODE 05
FIND POLPO'S FORTUNE!
